@WorkForce360.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5055
@employeeId = 1
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### Run once only, while the Users table has no accounts. Save the returned token.
POST {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/initialize-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.test",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Sign in after initialization
POST {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.test",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Admin only: create a user. Roles: Admin, HR, Manager, Employee, Recruiter.
POST {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr@example.test",
  "password": "TestPassword123",
  "role": "HR"
}

### Create an employee
POST {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeCode": "EMP1001",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Employee",
  "email": "test.employee@example.com",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "joiningDate": "2026-10-16",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "designation": "Developer",
  "employmentType": "FullTime",
  "status": "Active",
  "salary": 50000,
  "address": "Test Address"
}

### List employees with pagination, search, and department filter
GET {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee?department=Engineering&search=test&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get an employee
GET {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Replace an employee
PUT {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeCode": "EMP1001",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Employee",
  "email": "test.employee@example.com",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "joiningDate": "2026-10-16",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "designation": "Senior Developer",
  "employmentType": "FullTime",
  "status": "Active",
  "salary": 60000,
  "address": "Updated Test Address"
}

### Update only supplied fields. Do not leave a trailing comma in JSON.
PATCH {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Updated"
}

### Delete an employee
DELETE {{WorkForce360.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
